yamlover/stream
description: What a .yo file holds - today exactly one document
- >
  A **stream** is what a `.yo` file holds (the legacy `.yamlover` extension is read forever,
  written never). Today a file holds exactly ONE document; multi-document `---` streams are
  RESERVED - the multi-yamlover concrete is
  [defined but not yet implemented](::language:concretes:00-storage:04-multi_document_streams). The document's
  content is a yamlover/code - see its chapter:
- *: 00-yamlover_code
